// Feature: a generic struct `Cat<T>` (T in scope for all methods) with a spread of `&self`/`&mut self`
// methods: a mutating counter (`speak`/`meow`), a bool query (`contains_key`), a length, an inherent
// constructor `new`, and a `find(&self,&i64)->Option<&T>` returning a borrow of a field. isize/usize->
// i64/u64; `&self`->self:&Cat<T>, `&mut self`->self:&mut Cat<T>; println!/panic! dropped; String/
